@startuml SQ04_Manage_Personal_Info
title UC04 - Manage Personal Information Sequence Diagram (Code-based Flow)
autonumber "1:"
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

skinparam sequence {
    LifeLineBorderColor #000000
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
    ParticipantBorderColor #000000
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
    ParticipantFontColor #000000
    ParticipantFontSize 12
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
    ActorFontColor #000000
    ArrowColor #000000
    ArrowFontColor #000000
    GroupBorderColor #000000
}

actor "User" as User #7ACFF5
participant "<<boundary>>\nProfilePage.jsx" as ProfilePage #7ACFF5
participant "<<control>>\nprofileApi.js" as ProfileApi #7ACFF5
participant "<<control>>\nAccountProfileController" as ProfileController #7ACFF5
participant "<<control>>\nProfileServiceImpl" as ProfileServiceImpl #7ACFF5
participant "<<entity>>\nAccountRepository" as AccountRepository #7ACFF5
participant "<<entity>>\nAccountInformationRepository" as AccountInfoRepo #7ACFF5
participant "<<entity>>\nAuditLogRepository" as AuditLogRepo #7ACFF5
database "<<entity>>\nSQL Server (PMS DB)" as DB #7ACFF5

activate User #7ACFF5
== Phase 1: Fetch Profile Details ==
User -> ProfilePage: Access Personal Profile page (/profile)
activate ProfilePage #7ACFF5

ProfilePage -> ProfileApi: getProfile()
activate ProfileApi #7ACFF5

ProfileApi -> ProfileController: GET /api/v1/profile (Bearer AT)
activate ProfileController #7ACFF5

ProfileController -> ProfileServiceImpl: getProfile(accountId)
activate ProfileServiceImpl #7ACFF5

ProfileServiceImpl -> AccountRepository: findByIdWithDetails(accountId)
activate AccountRepository #7ACFF5
AccountRepository -> DB: SELECT a FROM Account a LEFT JOIN FETCH a.accountInformation LEFT JOIN FETCH a.role WHERE a.id=?
activate DB #7ACFF5
DB --> AccountRepository: Account entity
deactivate DB
AccountRepository --> ProfileServiceImpl: Account
deactivate AccountRepository

ProfileServiceImpl --> ProfileController: UserProfileResponse (fullName, email, phone, gender, dob, avatarUrl)
deactivate ProfileServiceImpl

ProfileController --> ProfileApi: HTTP 200 OK + ApiResponse.success(response)
deactivate ProfileController

ProfileApi --> ProfilePage: UserProfileResponse
deactivate ProfileApi

ProfilePage --> User: Display personal profile form pre-populated with user data

== Phase 2: Update Profile Information ==
User -> ProfilePage: Edit fullName, phone, address, gender, dateOfBirth, click "Lưu thông tin"
ProfilePage -> ProfilePage: Validate phone format and mandatory fields

ProfilePage -> ProfileApi: updateProfile(ProfileUpdateRequest)
activate ProfileApi #7ACFF5

ProfileApi -> ProfileController: PUT /api/v1/profile (ProfileUpdateRequest, Bearer AT)
activate ProfileController #7ACFF5

ProfileController -> ProfileServiceImpl: updateProfile(accountId, ProfileUpdateRequest, clientIp)
activate ProfileServiceImpl #7ACFF5

ProfileServiceImpl -> AccountRepository: findByIdWithDetails(accountId)
activate AccountRepository #7ACFF5
AccountRepository --> ProfileServiceImpl: Account entity
deactivate AccountRepository

ProfileServiceImpl -> AccountInfoRepo: findByAccountId(accountId)
activate AccountInfoRepo #7ACFF5
AccountInfoRepo -> DB: SELECT * FROM account_information WHERE account_id=?
activate DB #7ACFF5
DB --> AccountInfoRepo: AccountInformation entity (or empty)
deactivate DB
AccountInfoRepo --> ProfileServiceImpl: AccountInformation
deactivate AccountInfoRepo

ProfileServiceImpl -> AccountInfoRepo: Update fullName, phone, address, gender, dob, avatarUrl
activate AccountInfoRepo #7ACFF5
AccountInfoRepo -> DB: UPDATE account_information SET full_name=?, phone=?, address=?, gender=?, date_of_birth=? WHERE id=?
activate DB #7ACFF5
DB --> AccountInfoRepo: OK
deactivate DB
AccountInfoRepo --> ProfileServiceImpl: OK
deactivate AccountInfoRepo

ProfileServiceImpl -> AuditLogRepo: recordAuditLog(account, 'UPDATE_PROFILE_SUCCESS', clientIp)
activate AuditLogRepo #7ACFF5
AuditLogRepo -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (...)
activate DB #7ACFF5
DB --> AuditLogRepo: OK
deactivate DB
AuditLogRepo --> ProfileServiceImpl: OK
deactivate AuditLogRepo

ProfileServiceImpl --> ProfileController: UserProfileResponse (Updated profile)
deactivate ProfileServiceImpl

ProfileController --> ProfileApi: HTTP 200 OK + ApiResponse.success(response)
deactivate ProfileController

ProfileApi --> ProfilePage: Updated UserProfileResponse
deactivate ProfileApi

ProfilePage -> ProfilePage: Update user info in local state and AuthContext
ProfilePage --> User: Show Toast notification "Cập nhật hồ sơ thành công!"
deactivate ProfilePage
deactivate User
@enduml